        "annotations": {
            "action": "1) kubectl describe node \u003cnode\u003e 看 Conditions 与 Events，确认是 MemoryPressure、DiskPressure 还是 kubelet 失联；\n2) 登录节点确认 kubelet 与容器运行时进程状态（systemctl status kubelet containerd）；\n3) kubelet 日志用 journalctl -u kubelet -n 200 定位；\n4) 节点短期无法恢复的执行 kubectl drain 让 Pod 尽快迁走，避免等待驱逐超时。"
        },
        "extra_config": null,
        "create_at": 0,
        "create_by": "",
        "update_at": 0,
        "update_by": "",
        "uuid": 1717556327639942000
    },
    {
        "id": 0,
        "group_id": 0,
        "cate": "",
        "datasource_ids": null,
        "cluster": "",
        "name": "Node不可达",
        "note": "{{ $labels.node }} is unreachable and some workloads may be rescheduled.",
        "prod": "",
        "algorithm": "",
        "algo_params": null,
        "delay": 0,
        "severity": 2,
        "severities": null,
        "disabled": 0,
        "prom_for_duration": 900,
        "prom_ql": "(kube_node_spec_taint{job=\"kube-state-metrics\",key=\"node.kubernetes.io/unreachable\",effect=\"NoSchedule\"} unless ignoring(key,value) kube_node_spec_taint{job=\"kube-state-metrics\",key=~\"ToBeDeletedByClusterAutoscaler|cloud.google.com/impending-node-termination|aws-node-termination-handler/spot-itn\"}) == 1\n",
        "rule_config": null,
        "prom_eval_interval": 15,
        "enable_stime": "00:00",
        "enable_stimes": null,
        "enable_etime": "23:59",
        "enable_etimes": null,
        "enable_days_of_week": [
            "1",
            "2",
            "3",
            "4",
            "5",
            "6",
            "0"
        ],
        "enable_days_of_weeks": null,
        "enable_in_bg": 0,
        "notify_recovered": 1,
        "notify_channels": [],
        "notify_groups_obj": null,
        "notify_groups": null,
        "notify_repeat_step": 60,
        "notify_max_number": 0,
        "recover_duration": 0,
        "callbacks": [],
        "runbook_url": "",
        "append_tags": [],
        "annotations": {
            "action": "1) 先 ping / ssh 确认机器本身是否存活，机器宕机按宕机处理；\n2) 机器存活则排查节点到 apiserver 的网络与证书（kubelet 日志里会有明确报错）；\n3) 确认该节点上是否有单副本的关键服务，有的话优先在其他节点拉起；\n4) 恢复后确认节点重新 Ready 且 Pod 状态正常。"
        },
        "extra_config": null,
        "create_at": 0,
        "create_by": "",
        "update_at": 0,
        "update_by": "",
        "uuid": 1717556327640501000
    },
    {
        "id": 0,
        "group_id": 0,
        "cate": "",
        "datasource_ids": null,
        "cluster": "",
        "name": "Node运行太多Pod",
        "note": "Kubelet '{{ $labels.node }}' is running at {{ $value | humanizePercentage }} of its Pod capacity.",
        "prod": "",
        "algorithm": "",
        "algo_params": null,
        "delay": 0,
        "severity": 2,
        "severities": null,
        "disabled": 0,
        "prom_for_duration": 900,
        "prom_ql": "count by(node) (\n  (kube_pod_status_phase{job=\"kube-state-metrics\",phase=\"Running\"} == 1) * on(instance,pod,namespace,cluster) group_left(node) topk by(instance,pod,namespace,cluster) (1, kube_pod_info{job=\"kube-state-metrics\"})\n)\n/\nmax by(node) (\n  kube_node_status_capacity_pods{job=\"kube-state-metrics\"} != 1\n) \u003e 0.95\n",
        "rule_config": null,
        "prom_eval_interval": 15,
        "enable_stime": "00:00",
        "enable_stimes": null,
        "enable_etime": "23:59",
        "enable_etimes": null,
        "enable_days_of_week": [
            "1",
            "2",
            "3",
            "4",
            "5",
            "6",
            "0"
        ],
        "enable_days_of_weeks": null,
        "enable_in_bg": 0,
        "notify_recovered": 1,
        "notify_channels": [],
        "notify_groups_obj": null,
        "notify_groups": null,
        "notify_repeat_step": 60,
        "notify_max_number": 0,
        "recover_duration": 0,
        "callbacks": [],
        "runbook_url": "",
        "append_tags": [],
        "annotations": {
            "action": "1) kubectl get pod -A -o wide --field-selector spec.nodeName=\u003cnode\u003e | wc -l 确认实际数量；\n2) 对照 kubelet 的 maxPods 配置（默认 110）；\n3) 用 kubectl drain 或调整调度策略把部分 Pod 迁到其他节点；\n4) 确需更高密度的调大 maxPods，但要同步评估节点的 CPU/内存/PLEG 压力。"
        },
        "extra_config": null,
        "create_at": 0,
        "create_by": "",
        "update_at": 0,
        "update_by": "",
        "uuid": 1717556327641040000
    },
    {
        "id": 0,
        "group_id": 0,
        "cate": "",
        "datasource_ids": null,
        "cluster": "",
        "name": "Node状态抖动",
        "note": "The readiness status of node {{ $labels.node }} has changed {{ $value }} times in the last 15 minutes.",
        "prod": "",
        "algorithm": "",
        "algo_params": null,
        "delay": 0,
        "severity": 2,
        "severities": null,
        "disabled": 0,
        "prom_for_duration": 900,
        "prom_ql": "sum(changes(kube_node_status_condition{status=\"true\",condition=\"Ready\"}[15m])) by (node) \u003e 2\n",
        "rule_config": null,
        "prom_eval_interval": 15,
        "enable_stime": "00:00",
        "enable_stimes": null,
        "enable_etime": "23:59",
        "enable_etimes": null,
        "enable_days_of_week": [
            "1",
